  });
});
"}, "note": "The change makes toFixed receive undefined whenever any options object is given without decimalPlaces, so all fractional values round to integers; e.g. bytes(1536, {unitSeparator: ' '}) returns '2 KB' instead of '1.5 KB'. Gate runs confirmed the two builds diverge ('2 KB' patched vs '1.5 KB' original)."}
